        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: 8th Military Police Brigade, United States Army\n- Places: Schofield Barracks, Hawaii, Honolulu, Wahiawa District, Oʻahu\n\nFacts:\n- The 8th Military Police Brigade is a military police brigade of the United States Army.\n- The 8th Military Police Brigade is based at Schofield Barracks in Hawaii.\n- Schofield Barracks is a United States Army installation and a census-designated place.\n- Schofield Barracks is located in the City and County of Honolulu, in the Wahiawa District, on the island of Oʻahu in Hawaii.",
